add('b161','把擠壓地層收斂、讓壓行程與支護時序連成設計模型~Link squeezing-ground convergence, yielding travel and support timing','擠壓是高應力下的時間相依變形，不能直接等同材料遇水膨脹。~Squeezing is stress-driven time-dependent deformation and is not identical to water-induced swelling.','覆土由 500 增為 600 m、單位重 26 kN/m3，垂直應力由 13 增為 15.6 MPa；對 3 MPa 岩體強度的比由 4.33 變為 5.2，只作初篩。~At 26 kN/m3, cover rising from 500 to 600 m raises vertical stress from 13 to 15.6 MPa and its ratio to 3 MPa rock-mass strength from 4.33 to 5.2, for screening only.',r'''
應力強度比與初篩~Stress-strength ratio and screening§高覆土應力與低岩體強度的組合可能造成大變形，但垂直應力不代表完整三維應力場。完整岩樣強度也不同於節理岩體強度，將兩者混用會高估地層能力；比值只協助比較調查情境，不能單獨決定讓壓構件和開挖尺寸。~High cover stress combined with weak rock mass can produce large deformation, but vertical stress is not the full three-dimensional field. Intact-sample strength differs from jointed-rock strength. The ratio helps compare investigation scenarios but cannot alone determine yielding components or excavation geometry.§sigmaV=gamma*H=26 kN/m3*500 m=13 MPa; ratio=13/3=4.33§將原位應力方向、岩體分級與試樣強度分別列示~Report in-situ stress direction, rock-mass characterization and specimen strength separately§把完整岩樣強度當岩體強度，低估節理控制的大變形~Using intact strength for the rock mass understates joint-controlled deformation§應力強度比一個數字就能完全預測擠壓量~One stress-strength ratio completely predicts squeezing deformation
收斂拘束與交會點~Convergence-confinement intersection§地層反應曲線和支護曲線的交會描述特定假設下的平衡，安裝前收斂決定支護曲線起點。兩條曲線不是材料常數，開挖三維效應和時效會改變位置；比較方案必須固定地層模型，並保留支護介入時已發生的變形。~The ground-support curve intersection describes equilibrium under specified assumptions, with preinstallation convergence setting the support origin. Neither curve is a universal material constant. Three-dimensional excavation and time shift them, so compare schemes under consistent ground assumptions and retain deformation before support engagement.§supportPressure=k*(u-u0)=20 MPa/m*(0.08-0.03) m=1.0 MPa§比較安裝時位移零點、後續收斂及支護反力曲線~Compare installation displacement zero, subsequent convergence and support reaction curves§忽略安裝前變形讓支護反力起算過早，誤判剛度效果~Ignoring preinstallation motion starts support loading too early and misjudges stiffness effects§把支護做得最硬就一定能使總變形最小~The stiffest possible support always minimizes total deformation
讓壓平台與行程需求~Yielding plateau and travel demand§讓壓元件在變形中維持反力，目的是避免剛性支護過早超載，同時保留必要拘束。平台力太低可能無法穩住地層，行程太短則很快轉為高剛度；需把力、行程與地層預期收斂一起比較，不能只選最大吸能值。~A yielding element maintains restraint while deforming to avoid premature overload of rigid support. Too little force may not stabilize ground; too little travel quickly returns to high stiffness. Compare force and stroke against expected convergence rather than selecting the largest energy rating alone.§yieldWork=Fy*stroke=200 kN*0.15 m=30 kJ§記錄平台力、實際行程及行程末端的剛度改變~Record plateau force, actual travel and stiffness change near the stroke end§讓壓行程耗盡後反力陡增，導致相鄰噴層壓碎~Exhausted yielding travel sharply raises reaction and crushes adjacent shotcrete§元件可以讓壓就代表它的變形行程沒有上限~A yielding component has unlimited available deformation travel
預留變形與淨空消耗~Deformation allowance and clearance consumption§預留變形需要在開挖尺寸、支護厚度和永久淨空之間分配，不是任意放大洞徑。實際收斂可能不對稱，圓形平均半徑只會顯示總量而漏掉局部侵限；應用全斷面幾何檢核剩餘空間與後續襯砌需求。~Deformation allowance must be allocated among excavation, support and permanent clearance rather than simply enlarging the opening. Convergence can be asymmetric, so a mean radius hides local intrusion. Use complete profiles to assess remaining space and future lining requirements.§remainingAllowance=reserved-convergence=0.20 m-0.14 m=0.06 m§以各時期全斷面掃描比較預留量及永久襯砌輪廓~Compare full-section scans with allowances and permanent-lining geometry§局部收斂侵入襯砌空間，平均變形量卻仍在範圍內~Local convergence consumes lining space while mean movement still appears acceptable§平均收斂未超預留值就代表所有位置都不侵限~Mean convergence within allowance proves no local clearance intrusion
收斂速率與時效~Convergence rate and time dependence§擠壓地層可能在掌子面遠離後繼續變形，速率曲線有助區分短期卸載和持續蠕變。不同量測間隔會把尖峰平均掉，施工停頓也改變時間基準；比較需同時保留距面距離和真實經過時間，不應只按進尺排序。~Squeezing can continue after the face has moved away, and rates help distinguish immediate unloading from continuing creep. Sampling intervals average peaks, while stoppages change elapsed time. Preserve both distance from the face and real time rather than ordering observations solely by advance.§rate=(45-30) mm/(6-3) day=5 mm/day§用固定時間尺度與距面位置共同比較收斂速率~Compare convergence rates on consistent time intervals and face-relative positions§長停機期間的變形被漏記，使後續支護需求低估~Unrecorded deformation during a long stoppage understates later support demand§掌子面離開量測區後收斂就一定立即停止~Convergence necessarily stops as soon as the face leaves a monitored zone
拱架滑移接頭~Sliding joints in steel ribs§滑移接頭需在可控制反力下產生相對位移，摩擦和夾緊狀態決定啟動及持續力。各接頭若不均勻動作，整榀拱形可能偏轉，因而不能只確認某一接頭可以滑；應檢查整榀行程分配與噴層間隙相容。~Sliding joints must move under controlled resistance governed by friction and clamping. Uneven activation distorts the rib, so one functioning joint does not establish system behaviour. Check the distribution of travel around the rib and compatibility with gaps in the sprayed layer.§circumferentialShortening=numberOfJoints*equalTangentialSlip=4*20 mm=80 mm, only if kinematically compatible; not diametral convergence§逐接頭量測滑移、夾緊狀態與拱架輪廓變化~Measure slip and clamping at every joint together with rib-profile change§單側接頭卡住使其餘位置超滑，拱頂偏心受力~One jammed joint forces excessive slip elsewhere and shifts crown loading§每個接頭名義行程相加就是任何方向可用收斂~Adding nominal joint strokes gives available convergence in every direction
噴層間隙與局部壓碎~Shotcrete slots and local crushing§讓壓間隙允許環向縮短，但間隙端部會產生應力集中，填入不相容材料可能提早鎖死。開縫長度也不能簡單視為均勻應變，因為周圍噴層仍有彎曲與接觸；應把間隙閉合過程和鋼拱滑移一同追蹤。~Yield slots allow circumferential shortening but concentrate stress at their ends. Incompatible infill can lock them early. Slot closure is not uniform lining strain because adjacent shotcrete still bends and contacts ground; track it alongside steel-rib sliding rather than as an isolated gap.§gapConsumption=closed/initial=35 mm/50 mm=70 percent§量測各間隙剩餘寬度、端部裂紋及鄰近鋼拱滑移~Measure remaining slots, end cracks and nearby steel-rib slip§砂漿誤填讓壓間隙使反力突然增加並壓碎端部~Accidental mortar filling locks a yielding slot and crushes its ends§讓壓間隙填得越密實越能提高支護性能~Filling a yielding slot more densely always improves support performance
反算參數與可辨識性~Back-analysis and identifiability§一條收斂曲線可能由不同地層強度、模數或支護安裝時間組合產生，擬合良好不代表參數唯一。增加支護反力、孔內位移或獨立地質證據才能限制解的範圍；反算應呈現多組可能情境，而非只交一條最漂亮曲線。~Different ground strengths, moduli and installation times can reproduce one convergence curve, so fit quality does not imply uniqueness. Support reactions, borehole movement and independent geology constrain the solution. Report plausible alternatives rather than only the best-looking fitted curve.§normalizedResidual=abs(predicted-observed)/observed=abs(48-50)/50=4 percent§用保留的獨立量測區段檢驗反算參數的外推能力~Test back-calculated parameters against withheld independent monitoring sections§多參數互相補償得到良好擬合，遇新地層立即失準~Compensating parameters produce a good fit but fail immediately in different ground§反算曲線吻合就代表地層參數已唯一確定~A matching back-analysis curve uniquely determines the ground parameters
長期荷載與二次襯砌~Long-term load and secondary lining§二次襯砌完成後地層仍可能蠕變，初支和永久結構的分擔取決於接觸、剛度與施工時間。不能因外觀停止變形就假定永久荷載不再增加，儀器解析度也可能掩蓋慢速變化；設計應保留長期監測和可解釋的力學模型。~Ground may creep after secondary lining, with load sharing governed by contact, stiffness and timing. Apparently stopped movement does not prove constant permanent demand, and resolution can hide slow trends. Preserve long-term monitoring and an interpretable mechanical model for later comparisons.§annualIncrement=rate*time=0.02 mm/day*365 day=7.3 mm, constant-rate illustration only§比較長期收斂、接觸水壓及二次襯砌應變的趨勢~Compare long-term convergence, contact water pressure and secondary-lining strain trends§短期穩定被當成永久穩定，慢速蠕變逐年消耗淨空~Short-term stability is treated as permanent while slow creep consumes clearance over years§短期收斂速率低就能證明永久襯砌永不增載~A low short-term rate proves permanent lining loads will never increase
觀察法與調整證據~Observational design and adjustment evidence§觀察法需要事前定義可觀察量、可接受範圍及對應備案，並非看到問題後任意修改。讓壓行程、收斂速率和支護損傷反映不同邊界，調整前必須確認量測有效；版本追蹤可避免不同班組使用互相矛盾的支護假設。~Observational design requires predefined observables, acceptable ranges and contingency actions rather than arbitrary changes after trouble. Stroke, convergence rate and damage reveal different boundaries; confirm measurement validity before adjustment. Revision control prevents crews from using contradictory support assumptions.§verifiedTriggerCoverage=verifiedChannels/requiredChannels=5/6=83.3 percent§逐項核對觸發依據、儀器有效性、設計版本及核定責任~Audit trigger evidence, instrument validity, design revision and approval responsibility§失效感測器觸發錯誤支護調整，卻沒有留下決策依據~A failed sensor prompts an incorrect support change without a recorded rationale§觀察法就是可以依現場感覺隨時更改設計~Observational design means changing the design whenever field intuition suggests it
''')

add('b162','區分膨脹礦物、水源與受限變形的隧道設計~Distinguish swelling minerals, water supply and restrained deformation in tunnel design','自由膨脹率與受限膨脹壓力屬不同邊界，不能比例互換。~Free swelling and restrained swelling pressure belong to different boundaries and cannot be converted proportionally.','100 mm 試體自由高度增量由 4 增為 6 mm，膨脹率由 4% 增為 6%；不能推論受限壓力也增加 50%，因為邊界和反應非線性。~Increasing free height change from 4 to 6 mm in a 100 mm specimen raises swell from 4% to 6%; restrained pressure need not rise by 50% because boundary and response are nonlinear.',r'''
礦物反應與含水條件~Mineral reactions and water conditions§膨脹可能來自黏土吸水或礦物轉化，兩者對水化學、時間與應力狀態的反應不同。岩樣外觀不足以判別機制，需把礦物組成和取樣保存狀態一起記錄；遇水變形也可能混有軟化及崩解，不能都用同一膨脹係數描述。~Swelling may arise from clay hydration or mineral transformation, with different sensitivity to chemistry, time and stress. Appearance alone does not identify the mechanism; document mineralogy and sample preservation. Wetting deformation can also contain softening and slaking rather than a single swelling coefficient.§waterContent=(wetMass-dryMass)/dryMass=(120-100) g/100 g=20 percent§將礦物分析、天然含水率與取樣密封時間共同記錄~Record mineral analysis, natural water content and sample-sealing time together§樣本乾燥改變初始狀態，試驗反應無法代表原位地層~Sample drying changes its initial state and makes the test unrepresentative of ground§只看岩石外觀就能準確判斷所有膨脹機制~Rock appearance alone accurately identifies every swelling mechanism
自由膨脹與試體方向~Free swell and specimen direction§無側限或低荷重試驗可觀察自由變形，但層理方向會造成不同伸長，切樣擾動也會影響結果。自由膨脹不是隧道受限狀態，不能直接乘襯砌模數轉成壓力；應保留試體方向、浸水條件和量測時間。~Low-load tests reveal free deformation, but bedding direction and cutting disturbance affect elongation. Free swell is not the restrained tunnel state and cannot be converted into pressure by multiplying lining modulus. Retain orientation, wetting conditions and observation duration with every result.§freeSwell=heightIncrease/initialHeight=4 mm/100 mm=4 percent§比較平行及垂直層理試體的高度變化與吸水歷程~Compare height change and water uptake parallel and normal to bedding§只測有利方向低估另一方向膨脹，襯砌局部受壓增加~Testing only a favourable direction understates transverse swelling and local lining pressure§自由膨脹率可以直接換成受限膨脹壓力~Free-swell percentage directly converts to restrained swelling pressure
受限膨脹與反力~Restrained swell and reaction§限制變形的試驗量到維持邊界所需反力，結果受到儀器剛度、允許位移及浸水路徑影響。完全零變形是理想化，微小試架變形可能降低量得壓力；應將反力和位移一起呈現，不能只保留單一峰值。~A restrained test measures reaction needed to maintain a boundary, depending on apparatus stiffness, permitted movement and wetting path. Perfect zero displacement is idealized; small frame deformation can reduce measured pressure. Report reaction and movement together rather than a peak alone.§swellingPressure=force/area=25 kN/0.005 m2=5 MPa§校核試架柔度並同步保存試體位移、反力及水化時間~Check frame compliance and record specimen movement, reaction and wetting time together§試架變形釋放部分膨脹，誤以為地層壓力較低~Frame movement releases part of the swell and falsely suggests lower ground pressure§受限試驗的峰值不受儀器剛度影響~Peak restrained swelling pressure is independent of apparatus stiffness
力學軟化與膨脹區分~Softening versus swelling§吸水後強度下降可能造成承載下變形，即使自由膨脹不大也會影響隧道。若只量高度而不記作用應力，壓密和膨脹可能互相抵消；試驗須比較相同應力路徑下乾濕狀態，辨認反應是體積增加還是剛度降低。~Wetting can reduce strength and cause load-induced deformation despite modest free swell. Compaction and swelling may cancel in a height reading unless stress is recorded. Compare dry and wet states under the same stress path to distinguish volume increase from loss of stiffness.§strengthRetention=wetStrength/dryStrength=8 MPa/20 MPa=0.40§對照相同應力路徑的乾濕強度、體積變化與破壞型態~Compare dry-wet strength, volume change and failure mode under matching stress paths§把軟化引起的沉陷當成膨脹，選錯結構拘束策略~Settlement from softening is mistaken for swelling and leads to unsuitable restraint§遇水後產生的任何變形都只能叫做膨脹~Every deformation after wetting must be caused solely by swelling
水源路徑與暴露量~Water pathways and exposure volume§膨脹反應需要可接近的水源，施工用水、裂隙水及膜後積水會形成不同暴露條件。流入量不是全部被礦物吸收，排出、蒸發和儲存都應列入水量帳；改善排導可能減少接觸，但不能保證已開始的反應立即停止。~Swelling requires accessible water from construction, fractures or trapped drainage. Inflow is not identical to mineral uptake because discharge, evaporation and storage also matter. Improved drainage can reduce exposure but does not guarantee immediate cessation of reactions already under way.§exposureVolume=q*t=0.2 L/min*1440 min=288 L over one day§追蹤各水源、流量及接觸區域，與變形時間曲線配對~Track water sources, flows and contact zones against deformation histories§施工水滯留在仰拱下促進反應，卻被誤認為自然地下水~Process water trapped beneath the invert promotes reaction but is mistaken for natural groundwater§把排水量降低就能證明礦物完全停止吸水~Lower measured drainage proves minerals have completely stopped taking up water
膨脹層厚度與隆起~Swelling-layer thickness and heave§表面隆起是不同深度應變的積分，不是單點試體膨脹率直接套用全覆土。受反應影響的厚度取決於水路、礦物及拘束，局部薄層也可能產生差異隆起；孔內分層量測有助辨認變形來源和活躍深度。~Heave integrates strain through depth rather than applying one specimen percentage to all overburden. Active thickness depends on water paths, minerals and restraint, and a thin local layer can create differential uplift. Layered downhole measurements help identify the deforming interval.§heave=averageStrain*activeThickness=0.02*2 m=0.04 m=40 mm§用多深度錨點與地層取樣定位膨脹活躍層~Locate active swelling layers using multidepth anchors and geological samples§把整個覆土當活躍層高估隆起，或漏掉局部薄層差異變形~Treating all cover as active overstates heave while missed thin layers hide differential motion§地表隆起除以總覆土就能得到唯一膨脹率~Surface heave divided by total cover gives the unique swelling strain
仰拱拘束與接觸壓力~Invert restraint and contact pressure§剛性仰拱限制隆起卻可能增加反力，可壓縮層則用變形空間減少部分壓力。兩者是力與位移的取捨，不能假設兼得零隆起與零壓力；設計需檢查可壓縮層耗盡後的行為以及長期水化反應。~A stiff invert limits heave but can increase reaction, while a compressible layer trades space for reduced pressure. Zero movement and zero pressure cannot both be assumed. Check behaviour after compressible travel is exhausted and account for continuing long-term hydration.§compressionReserve=layerTravel-usedTravel=100 mm-65 mm=35 mm§量測仰拱隆起、界面壓力與可壓縮層剩餘厚度~Measure invert heave, interface pressure and remaining compressible-layer thickness§可壓縮層耗盡後壓力急增，原先緩慢隆起轉為結構裂損~Exhausted compression space sharply raises pressure and turns slow heave into cracking§設置柔軟墊層就能永久消除所有膨脹作用~A soft layer permanently eliminates every swelling action
反應速率與外推~Reaction rate and extrapolation§短期浸水試驗可能只涵蓋快速階段，慢速礦物轉化則持續更久。固定速率外推只能作敏感度練習，反應可能隨水源、溫度或可反應材料耗減而改變；監測應保留完整曲線和停滯區間，避免只取最近兩點。~Short wetting tests can capture a rapid stage while slower transformation continues. Constant-rate extrapolation is only a sensitivity exercise because water, temperature and reactant depletion change rates. Preserve complete curves and pauses rather than interpreting the latest two points alone.§illustrativeHeave=constantRate*time=0.5 mm/month*24 month=12 mm§比較長期曲線分段速率與溫度、水位及取樣礦物變化~Compare long-term segment rates with temperature, head and mineral changes§短期平台被當成反應結束，後續供水恢復後再次隆起~A short plateau is treated as reaction completion before heave resumes with renewed water§觀察到短期不變就證明膨脹反應已永久結束~A short period without change proves swelling has permanently ended
排水相容與環境影響~Drainage compatibility and environmental effects§抽排水可能減少局部水接觸，但也會改變有效應力、地表沉陷及水化學，不能把降低水位當成無代價方案。膜、排水和結構設計必須使用一致邊界，並考慮長期堵塞；評估應分開水量效果與材料反應效果。~Drainage can reduce contact but also alters effective stress, settlement and chemistry, so lower head is not consequence-free. Membranes, drains and structural models need compatible boundaries including blockage. Separate hydraulic effects from mineral reaction effects when assessing performance.§effectiveStressChange=gammaWater*headDrop=9.81 kN/m3*3 m=29.43 kPa§同時監測水位、地表沉陷及仰拱反應而非只看出水量~Monitor head, surface settlement and invert response rather than discharge alone§降水減少膨脹供水卻引起鄰地壓密，單一指標誤判成功~Dewatering reduces swelling supply but consolidates nearby ground, misleading a single-metric assessment§降低地下水位對所有地下工程都只有正面效果~Lowering groundwater has only beneficial effects for every underground structure
長期維護與反應地圖~Long-term maintenance and reaction maps§膨脹地層的維護需要把材料、水路和變形共同定位，單純裂縫修補不能消除持續反應。後續管線漏水或排水改造可能重新供水，因此設施變更應回到原地質模型；交接圖須標示活躍層、監測基準及仍未確認區域。~Maintenance must locate material, water paths and movement together; crack repair alone does not stop reaction. Later utility leaks or drainage changes can resupply water, so alterations should revisit the geological model. Map active layers, monitoring references and unresolved areas for handover.§mappedCoverage=verifiedReactiveZones/identifiedZones=9/12=75 percent§將礦物區、滲流路徑、隆起及維修紀錄疊合審查~Review mineral zones, seepage paths, heave and repair records as a combined map§新增管線漏水使休眠區重新反應，而維護資料沒有地質連結~A new utility leak reactivates a zone absent from geology-linked maintenance records§裂縫修補完成就代表膨脹地層已經永久穩定~Completing crack repairs proves the swelling ground is permanently stable
''')
add('b163','用水頭、壓力損失與滲流證據評估高水壓止水灌漿~Assess high-head water-control grouting using head, pressure loss and seepage evidence','算例只描述水力關係，不提供現地配方、注入壓力或施作授權。~Examples describe hydraulic relationships, not field recipes, injection pressures or operating authorization.','水頭由 80 增為 100 m，淡水靜壓由 0.7848 增為 0.981 MPa；泵壓仍須修正高程及沿程損失，不能把差值當成允許提高注壓的指令。~Increasing freshwater head from 80 to 100 m raises static pressure from 0.7848 to 0.981 MPa; pump readings still require elevation and loss corrections, not an instruction to increase field pressure.',r'''
水頭基準與孔隙水壓~Head datum and pore pressure§高水壓首先是水位與量測點高程的關係，埋深不一定等於水頭。承壓含水層可在地表以上形成測壓水位，不同孔段也可能不連通；應把量測位置和基準高程清楚標出，再比較外部水壓與隧道內部條件。~High pressure depends on piezometric level relative to the measurement point, not burial depth alone. Confined levels may exceed ground surface and different intervals may be disconnected. Identify measurement elevations and datums before comparing external water pressure with tunnel conditions.§Inputs rho=1000 kg/m3, g=9.81 m/s2, h=80 m; p=rho*g*h=1000*9.81*80=784800 Pa=0.7848 MPa§將分段測壓水位、孔口高程及量測深度換到共同基準~Reduce interval heads, collar elevations and measurement depths to a common datum§混用地表深度與水頭使設計水壓估錯，錯判止水需求~Confusing depth with head misestimates water pressure and water-control demand§隧道埋得多深就一定有完全相同的地下水頭~Tunnel burial depth always equals the groundwater head
泵表讀值與孔段壓力~Pump gauge and interval pressure§泵表位置和目標孔段高程不同，管線摩擦及局部損失也使讀值不能直接當孔內壓力。壓差隨流量、材料和管路狀態改變，靜止時與流動時的校核意義不同；必須定義正負高程和壓力類型，避免重複扣除水頭。~Gauge elevation differs from the target interval, while line and local losses prevent direct transfer of readings. Loss changes with flow, material and pipe condition, so static and flowing checks differ. Define elevation signs and pressure type to avoid counting head corrections twice.§Inputs conveyed-fluid density=1000 kg/m3, g=9.81 m/s2, downward elevation change=10 m; pInterval=0.90 MPa+0.0981 MPa-0.15 MPa=0.8481 MPa; another grout density requires recalculating the hydrostatic term§以可用孔段壓力、流量及管路校核共同檢查泵表換算~Check gauge conversion using available interval pressure, flow and line calibration§只讀泵表而忽略堵管損失，誤以為目標地層已受相同壓力~Ignoring line blockage losses falsely assigns gauge pressure to the target ground§泵表壓力永遠等於灌漿孔段實際壓力~Pump-gauge pressure always equals actual pressure in the treated interval
孔隙壓與有效作用差~Pore pressure and net pressure difference§注入端壓力與原地下水壓之差影響流動，但不能單獨決定地層是否會開裂或抬升。最小主應力、既有裂隙與連通路徑同樣重要，局部壓力還可能傳到遠處薄弱面；模型應區分水力驅動差與允許作用上限。~The difference between injection and groundwater pressure drives flow but does not alone establish fracture or uplift risk. Minimum stress, existing joints and connectivity also matter, with pressure reaching remote weak planes. Distinguish a hydraulic driving difference from an allowable action limit.§netDifference=0.8481 MPa-0.7848 MPa=0.0633 MPa=63.3 kPa§對照孔段壓差、周邊位移及相鄰測壓反應~Compare interval pressure difference with surrounding movement and neighbouring head responses§把淨壓差小誤當無風險，忽略遠處低拘束裂隙開啟~A small net difference is treated as risk-free despite remote low-restraint joints opening§淨注入壓差低就能保證任何地層都不會開裂~A low net injection difference guarantees no ground can fracture
裂隙開度與流量敏感度~Fracture aperture and flow sensitivity§理想平行板層流的流量對開度立方敏感，微小開合可大幅改變流量。天然裂隙粗糙、分岔且有接觸點，不能從一個流量唯一反算開度；此模型適合解釋為何少數連通裂隙可能主導整體漏水。~Ideal parallel-plate laminar flow varies with aperture cubed, so small changes can strongly alter discharge. Natural joints are rough, branching and partly contacting, preventing unique aperture inference from one flow. The model explains why a few connected fractures can dominate leakage.§flowRatio=(newAperture/oldAperture)^3=(1.1)^3=1.331§在可比水頭下比較分段流量與裂隙連通證據~Compare interval flow and fracture connectivity at comparable heads§只封小裂隙卻漏掉主通道，總流量改善有限~Sealing minor cracks while missing the main pathway gives little total-flow improvement§所有裂隙對總漏水的貢獻都大致相同~Every fracture contributes approximately equally to total leakage
幾何體積與實際注入量~Geometric volume and delivered volume§理想處理環體積可作材料帳基準，但地層不是均勻多孔體，注入可能集中在少數通道。超過理論體積並不證明處理半徑增加，可能是外逸或相鄰孔連通；必須把材料去向和地下水反應一起辨認。~An ideal treatment annulus offers a volume baseline, but ground is not a uniform porous medium and delivery may concentrate in a few channels. Excess volume does not prove a larger treatment radius; it may escape or connect to another hole. Interpret material destinations with groundwater response.§Inputs r=0.5 m, r0=0.05 m, L=3 m, assumedConnectedVoidFraction=0.10; V=pi*(r^2-r0^2)*L*n=pi*(0.5^2-0.05^2)*3*0.10=0.233 m3§將注入收支、相鄰孔反應及可見逸流位置共同索引~Index delivered balance, neighbouring-hole responses and visible escape locations together§大量外逸被當成有效填充，留下未處理的高滲區~Large losses are credited as useful filling while high-permeability zones remain untreated§注入量達理論體積就能證明處理半徑完全達成~Delivered theoretical volume proves the complete treatment radius has been achieved
材料可灌性與粒徑~Grout penetrability and particle size§材料能否進入裂隙取決於粒徑分布、開度、流變和過濾作用，平均粒徑不能代表最大團聚體。入口堵塞可能讓孔口壓力升高但深部仍未處理，因而壓力與流量變化不能直接解讀為地層已封閉；材料選擇需要相容試驗證據。~Penetrability depends on size distribution, aperture, rheology and filtration, not mean particle size alone. Entrance clogging can raise collar pressure while leaving deeper ground untreated. Pressure-flow changes therefore do not directly establish closure and material selection needs compatibility evidence.§geometricRatio=aperture/d95=0.20 mm/0.04 mm=5, not a universal penetrability criterion§比較材料粒徑、濾失試驗與壓力流量曲線的形狀~Compare particle distribution, filtration tests and pressure-flow curve shapes§孔口濾餅造成假性拒漿，深部水路仍持續連通~An entrance filter cake produces apparent refusal while deeper pathways remain connected§入口壓力升高就能證明整個處理區都已封閉~Rising entrance pressure proves the entire treated zone is sealed
前後透水比較與水頭~Before-after permeability and head§處理前後流量若在不同水頭下量測，直接百分比可能混入地下水自然變化。線性水力導通度只適用特定範圍，裂隙開合會造成非線性；比較應使用相同孔段、時間尺度及可比邊界，並保留未達穩態的資料註記。~Before-after flows measured at different heads mix treatment with natural groundwater change. Linear conductance applies only over a specified range because joint opening can be nonlinear. Compare the same intervals and time scales under similar boundaries and identify readings that have not reached steady conditions.§reduction=(Qbefore-Qafter)/Qbefore=(10-2) L/min/10 L/min=80 percent at equal head§在相同孔段和可比水頭下比較穩態流量及恢復曲線~Compare steady flow and recovery curves in matching intervals at comparable heads§天然水位下降被錯算成灌漿成效，雨季水頭恢復後再漏~Natural head decline is credited to treatment and leakage returns when seasonal head recovers§處理後流量降低就一定全部來自灌漿改善~Every post-treatment flow decrease is entirely caused by grouting improvement
地層抬升與遠端反應~Ground uplift and remote response§壓力傳遞可能超出預期處理半徑，薄弱界面或地表覆土較少處會先變形。孔口附近沒有移動不能排除遠端反應，鄰近結構與水位也可能提供訊息；監測範圍應由地質連通模型決定，而不是固定圍住設備。~Pressure transmission can extend beyond the assumed treatment radius and deform weak or shallow interfaces first. No collar movement does not exclude remote response; nearby structures and heads supply additional evidence. Base monitoring coverage on geological connectivity rather than a fixed circle around equipment.§upliftGradient=levelDifference/distance=2 mm/10 m=0.0002§將地表水準、結構位移和相鄰孔壓放在共同時間軸~Align surface levels, structural movement and neighbouring pore pressures§遠端抬升先發生卻未佈點，局部監測誤判沒有影響~Uninstrumented remote uplift begins while local monitoring falsely suggests no effect§孔口周圍沒變形就能證明所有遠端地層都沒反應~No movement near the collar proves all distant ground remains unaffected
水化學與耐久相容~Water chemistry and durability compatibility§止水材料長期接觸地下水，化學侵蝕、溶出或體積變化可能改變密封效果。短期不漏不等於材料與環境相容，溫度和流速也影響暴露；試驗應比較服務環境下的留存性能，而非只採容易得到的室內浸泡結果。~Water-control materials remain exposed to groundwater, where attack, leaching and volume change can alter sealing. Initial tightness does not establish compatibility, and temperature and flow affect exposure. Compare retained performance under representative service conditions rather than convenient immersion results alone.§retainedStrength=aged/reference=8 MPa/10 MPa=80 percent§將水質、溫度及老化後滲透與強度資料共同審查~Review water chemistry, temperature and post-ageing permeability and strength together§材料溶出留下新通道，短期合格卻長期重新滲漏~Material leaching creates new pathways despite initially passing leakage checks§施工後短期不漏就代表材料永遠不會劣化~Initial absence of leakage proves the material will never deteriorate
驗收範圍與長期水路~Acceptance coverage and long-term pathways§止水效果需針對設計範圍與地下水邊界驗證，單孔低透水不能代表全部帷幕連續。水可能繞過未處理端部或沿新裂隙改道，交接應保存孔段、材料、量測水頭與未驗證區；維護才能分辨原缺口和後續變化。~Verify the design volume and groundwater boundary rather than treating low permeability in one hole as continuous coverage. Water can bypass ends or take new fractures. Preserve intervals, materials, test heads and unverified zones so maintenance distinguishes original gaps from later changes.§verificationCoverage=verifiedIntervals/requiredIntervals=36/40=90 percent§將獨立驗證孔段與處理範圍及未驗證區逐一對照~Compare independent verification intervals with treatment extent and unverified zones§帷幕端部未封閉讓水繞流，中心孔合格仍無法控制湧水~An open treatment edge permits bypass despite passing central holes§中心驗證孔合格就能代表整個止水範圍連續~A passing central verification hole proves the entire water barrier is continuous
''')
add('b164','用流量收支、重力排水與泵站備援管理隧道湧水~Manage tunnel inflow through flow balance, gravity drainage and pump redundancy','排水降低局部水頭，也可能改變鄰地有效應力與水資源邊界。~Drainage lowers local head but may also change surrounding effective stress and water-resource boundaries.','總排水保持 80 L/s，施工用水由 25 增為 35 L/s，推估地層湧水由 55 降為 45 L/s；總量不變可能掩蓋來源改變。~At a constant total discharge of 80 L/s, process water rising from 25 to 35 L/s reduces inferred groundwater inflow from 55 to 45 L/s; unchanged totals can conceal changing sources.',r'''
地下水與施工用水收支~Groundwater and process-water balance§排水總量同時包含地層湧水、施工用水和儲存變化，不能全部算成天然地下水。泵站啟停造成出水脈動，應在相同時間窗比較流入與流出；若水槽水位改變，還須加入庫容項才可辨認真正湧水趨勢。~Discharge combines groundwater, process water and storage change rather than natural inflow alone. Pump cycling makes outlet flow intermittent, requiring equal accounting windows. Include changing sump volume to identify the underlying groundwater trend instead of confusing operational pulses with geology.§Qground=Qout-Qprocess=80 L/s-25 L/s=55 L/s at constant storage§同步記錄總出水、施工用水與集水槽水位變化~Synchronize total discharge, process-water use and sump-level changes§施工用水增加被誤判為地層突湧，導致錯誤地質處置~Higher process-water use is mistaken for groundwater inflow and prompts the wrong geological response§泵站量到的全部出水都是地層自然湧水~All water measured at the pump outlet is natural groundwater inflow
支管流速與有效斷面~Branch velocity and effective area§支管輸水能力受實際有效斷面影響，沉積、變形和局部堵塞都會改變速度與水位。用公稱管徑計算可能漏掉積泥，量測高流速也不一定表示容量充足，因為上游可能已積水；應同時看流量、斷面與水頭。~Branch performance depends on effective area altered by sediment, deformation and blockage. Nominal diameter can miss deposits, and high velocity does not prove spare capacity if water is already backing up. Interpret flow, section geometry and head together rather than velocity alone.§Q=A*v=0.020 m2*0.8 m/s=0.016 m3/s=16 L/s§量測流速、積泥厚度及上游水位以還原有效斷面~Measure velocity, deposit depth and upstream level to reconstruct effective area§積泥縮小斷面導致水位抬升，名義管徑仍看似足夠~Sediment reduces area and raises head while nominal diameter still appears adequate§名義管徑足夠就不需要檢查有效過水斷面~Adequate nominal diameter removes the need to check effective flow area
重力管線與坡度~Gravity pipe and gradient§重力排水依靠水面或能量坡降，管底設計坡度不一定等於實際水力坡降。接頭錯台與局部反坡會形成積泥，端點高程正確也可能漏掉中段低窪；Manning 模型只在定義清楚的均勻流條件下提供基準。~Gravity drainage follows a water-surface or energy gradient, which need not equal the designed invert grade. Steps and reverse slopes trap sediment despite correct endpoints. Manning's equation gives a baseline only under a clearly defined uniform-flow condition, not arbitrary backwater or pressurized flow.§Inputs n=0.013 s/m^(1/3), A=0.07069 m2, R=0.075 m, S=0.005; Q=(1/n)*A*R^(2/3)*S^0.5=(1/0.013)*0.07069*0.075^(2/3)*0.005^0.5=0.0684 m3/s§沿線水準與管內影像共同查核反坡、錯台及沉積~Use longitudinal levels and internal images to check reverse slopes, steps and deposits§中段沉陷形成水袋，兩端坡度合格卻持續堵塞~A midline sag traps water and repeatedly blocks despite acceptable endpoint grade§排水管兩端高程正確就代表中間一定順坡~Correct end elevations guarantee a continuously descending drain
泵站揚程與耗能~Pump head and power§泵站需要克服靜揚程、沿程損失及局部損失，額定流量只對應特定工作點。效率隨工況改變，不能將馬達功率直接等同水力輸出；並聯泵也不一定讓流量倍增，因為系統曲線會隨流量上升。~Pumps overcome static lift, friction and local losses, with rated flow tied to a duty point. Efficiency changes with operation, so motor power is not hydraulic output. Parallel pumps need not double discharge because the system curve rises with total flow.§Inputs rho=1000 kg/m3, g=9.81 m/s2, Q=0.055 m3/s, H=20 m, eta=0.70; P=rho*g*Q*H/eta=1000*9.81*0.055*20/0.70=15416 W=15.4 kW§比較實測流量、吸排壓差與輸入功率對應工作點~Compare measured flow, suction-discharge pressure difference and input power at the duty point§沿程阻力增大把泵推離有效工況，耗電高但排水不足~Growing line resistance shifts duty away from efficient operation, using power without adequate drainage§泵浦銘牌流量就是任何現地管路都能得到的流量~Nameplate pump flow is available in every installed pipeline system
集水容量與反應時間~Sump storage and response time§集水槽提供短暫流量緩衝，實際可用容量要扣除沉積、最低運轉水位與不可用空間。以總幾何容積除湧水量會高估反應時間，泵停機後流入也可能變化；需使用可用容量和明確情境，而非把時間當成工作許可。~A sump buffers temporary imbalance, with usable storage reduced by sediment, minimum operating levels and dead space. Gross volume divided by inflow overstates response time, while inflow can change after pump failure. Use available storage under a stated scenario rather than treating the time as permission to act.§storageNeeded=Q*t=0.055 m3/s*600 s=33 m3§核對槽內有效水位區間、沉積量及停泵水位上升紀錄~Check usable level range, sediment and observed level rise during approved pump tests§沉積佔用緩衝容量，停機後比預估更快溢流~Sediment consumes buffer storage and overflow occurs sooner than predicted§集水槽總容積全部都能當作停泵備援容量~The entire gross sump volume is available as pump-failure storage
備援容量與共同失效~Redundancy and common failures§備用泵能處理單機故障，卻不能自動解決共用電源、吸水口或排水幹管失效。備援評估應沿完整鏈找共同點，並檢查切換期間儲存量；設備數量多不代表功能獨立，需要以故障情境而非台數證明韌性。~A standby pump addresses one unit's failure but not shared power, intake or discharge-line loss. Trace common dependencies and storage during transfer. More equipment does not establish functional independence; demonstrate resilience through failure scenarios rather than pump count alone.§remainingCapacity=2*40 L/s=80 L/s after one of three equal pumps fails§逐一核對電源、控制、吸水和排水共用點及切換試驗~Audit shared power, control, intake and discharge points alongside transfer tests§全部泵共用堵塞吸水口，備用機雖正常也無法排水~All pumps share a blocked intake, so a healthy standby still cannot drain§多裝一台備用泵就能排除所有排水失效~Adding one standby pump eliminates every drainage failure
堵塞敏感度與維護~Blockage sensitivity and maintenance§沉積會同時減少面積與水力半徑，輸水能力下降可能快於直徑比例。此直徑尺度關係假定幾何相似的圓形有效通道滿流，Manning n 與能量坡度不變；任意底部沉積形狀或部分滿流不能沿用同一冪次。清理效果應以恢復後水位和流量驗證，而不只看清出多少沉積物。~Deposits reduce both area and hydraulic radius, making capacity fall faster than diameter alone. The scaling assumes geometrically similar circular effective passages flowing full, with unchanged Manning n and energy slope. Arbitrary bottom deposits or partially full flow do not follow the same diameter exponent. Verify cleaning by recovered head and flow rather than the removed sediment mass alone.§capacityRatio=(0.8)^(8/3)=0.5515 for geometrically similar circular effective passages flowing full at unchanged Manning n and energy slope; not arbitrary deposited-section geometry§比較清理前後有效斷面、水位與相同流量下壓降~Compare effective section, level and pressure loss at equal flow before and after cleaning§只清可見口部而保留深部堵塞，水位很快再次抬升~Cleaning only the visible outlet leaves deep blockage and head quickly rises again§管徑減少百分之二十就只會少百分之二十排水能力~A twenty-percent diameter loss reduces drainage capacity by only twenty percent
濾層與細粒流失~Filters and loss of fines§排水需要讓水通過又限制地層細粒移動，濾層不相容會引起內部侵蝕或快速堵塞。出水突然變濁可能反映顆粒流失，但施工泥水也能造成類似現象；應結合粒徑、流量和地表變形，避免只以清澈程度判定穩定。~Drainage must pass water while retaining ground fines; incompatible filters can erode internally or clog quickly. Turbidity may indicate soil loss but also construction slurry. Combine particle distribution, flow and ground movement rather than judging stability solely from water clarity.§gradient=deltaHead/pathLength=2 m/0.5 m=4, requiring soil-specific assessment§比對濾層粒徑、濁度、排水量與附近沉陷趨勢~Compare filter grading, turbidity, discharge and nearby settlement trends§細粒被帶走形成隱藏空洞，出水量正常仍可能損失地層~Escaping fines create hidden voids despite apparently normal discharge§排水量沒有增加就能保證地層沒有流失~Unchanged discharge guarantees that no ground material is being lost
水質負荷與排放處理~Water-quality load and treatment§排水水質管理應同時看濃度和流量，低濃度的大流量仍可能有很大污染物質量。沉澱槽處理懸浮固體不等於去除溶解物，應按成分選擇驗證量；課程的質量帳只描述工程尺度，不取代所在地排放要求。~Water management needs both concentration and flow: dilute high-volume discharge can carry a large mass. Settling removes suspended solids rather than every dissolved species, requiring constituent-specific verification. The mass balance describes engineering scale and does not replace local discharge requirements.§massLoad=Q*C=0.05 m3/s*0.20 kg/m3=0.010 kg/s=36 kg/h§同步取樣流量與代表性濃度並比較處理前後質量收支~Sample representative concentration and flow together and compare treatment mass balances§只看濃度降低忽略稀釋增流，總污染質量其實未下降~Concentration falls through dilution while total discharged contaminant mass remains unchanged§出水濃度下降就一定代表排出污染總量下降~Lower effluent concentration necessarily means a lower total contaminant discharge
長期水文與維護交接~Long-term hydrology and handover§隧道排水可能長期改變周邊地下水位，運轉資料需要與降雨、泉水和鄰地沉陷共同解讀。不同季節的同一流量不一定代表相同地層狀態，感測器和排水改造也會改變基準；交接應保存來源分區和維護歷程。~Tunnel drainage can alter regional groundwater over time, requiring interpretation with rainfall, springs and settlement. Equal seasonal flows need not represent equal ground conditions, while sensor or drainage changes shift baselines. Preserve source zones and maintenance history for later assessment.§headTrend=(18-21) m/6 month=-0.5 m/month, not proof of causation§將降雨、地下水位、分區排水與清理事件共同分析~Analyze rainfall, groundwater levels, zoned discharge and cleaning events together§把季節乾旱全歸因隧道排水，或忽略持續抽排的影響~Seasonal drought is entirely blamed on drainage, or persistent drainage effects are ignored§隧道排水變化可以完全不參考周邊水文資料~Tunnel discharge changes can be interpreted without surrounding hydrological data
''')

add('b165','以水源診斷、活動裂縫與修補相容性處理既有隧道漏水~Repair existing-tunnel leakage through source diagnosis, active-crack assessment and material compatibility','可見出水口不一定是入水缺陷，修補不得破壞原有洩壓與排水路徑。~The visible outlet need not be the entry defect; repair must preserve intended pressure relief and drainage.','露點保持 14°C，表面溫度由 12 升為 15°C，溫度餘裕由 -2 變為 +1°C；這只改變凝結可能性，不能排除同時存在的裂縫滲漏。~At a fixed 14 C dew point, surface temperature rising from 12 to 15 C changes the margin from -2 to +1 C; this changes condensation potential but does not exclude simultaneous crack leakage.',r'''
凝結與地下水來源~Condensation and groundwater sources§潮濕表面可能來自冷凝、地層滲水或管線漏水，三者有不同控制方法。表面溫度低於露點支持凝結可能性，但不是唯一來源證明；空間分布、水質與時間變化應共同檢查，避免把整面冷凝誤當防水膜大面積破損。~Wet surfaces can arise from condensation, groundwater or utilities, requiring different remedies. A surface below dew point supports condensation but does not exclude other sources. Combine spatial distribution, chemistry and timing rather than treating widespread condensation as widespread membrane failure.§temperatureMargin=surface-dewPoint=12 C-14 C=-2 C§同步量測表面溫度、露點、水質與濕區分布~Measure surface temperature, dew point, chemistry and wet-area distribution together§凝結被當成裂縫漏水灌補，濕氣問題仍然存在~Condensation is treated as crack leakage and persists after sealing§只要隧道表面有水就一定是地下水穿過裂縫~Any water on a tunnel surface must be groundwater passing through a crack
漏水量級與時間窗~Leakage scale and time windows§水滴頻率受滴頭形狀影響，不能不經校正就換成流量。集水時間窗需要涵蓋變化，維修前後也應使用相似水頭與環境；小流量持續多年仍可形成可觀水量和腐蝕暴露，因此應同時描述瞬時量與累積量。~Drop frequency depends on outlet geometry and needs calibration before conversion to flow. Collection windows should capture variability and comparisons require similar head and environment. A small persistent leak can create substantial volume and corrosion exposure, so describe instantaneous and accumulated quantities.§dailyVolume=0.5 L/min*1440 min/day=720 L/day=0.72 m3/day§以容積計時或流量計記錄同一漏點並保留水頭條件~Measure the same leak by timed volume or flow meter and retain head conditions§短時乾燥被當成修復成功，水頭回升後漏水恢復~A short dry interval is treated as repair success before leakage returns with rising head§漏水量很小就不會累積成任何耐久問題~A small leak can never accumulate into a durability problem
裂縫活動與開合尺度~Crack activity and opening scale§裂縫可能隨溫度、交通或地層變形反覆開合，靜態寬度不能代表活動範圍。修補材料需要適應裂縫位移而不只是填滿當下空隙；不同方向的剪移與張開也有不同界面需求，應在設計前取得可比時間序列。~Cracks can cycle with temperature, traffic or ground movement; static width does not describe their range. Repair needs movement compatibility rather than simply filling the current void. Shear and opening impose different interface demands, requiring comparable time histories before selecting a system.§openingRange=max-min=0.35 mm-0.20 mm=0.15 mm§以裂縫計對照溫度、荷載事件及相鄰結構位移~Compare crack-gauge records with temperature, load events and neighbouring movement§活動裂縫採剛性填補後沿界面再裂，漏水很快回復~Rigid filling of an active crack fractures again along the interface and leakage returns§裂縫當下很細就表示它沒有任何活動~A narrow crack at one instant proves it has no movement
裂隙導流與非線性~Fracture conductance and nonlinearity§理想裂隙流量對開度立方敏感，封閉一部分通道可能大幅改變流量，也可能讓水改走另一支路。天然裂縫的接觸及粗糙度限制此模型適用性，不能只靠出水量反推出唯一裂縫寬度；需用實測開合和水頭補足解釋。~Ideal fracture flow varies cubically with aperture, so partial closure can strongly change discharge or redirect it. Contact and roughness limit the model, preventing unique width inference from outlet flow. Pair measured opening and head to interpret apparent hydraulic improvement.§flowRatio=(0.15 mm/0.20 mm)^3=0.4219 at equal pressure gradient§在可比水頭下比較裂縫開口、流量及鄰近漏點變化~Compare crack opening, flow and neighbouring leaks under comparable heads§單點流量下降只是水路改道，總湧水量沒有改善~A local flow decrease merely redirects water and leaves total inflow unchanged§某個漏點不再出水就能證明水源已被完全封住~One dry outlet proves the complete water source has been sealed
水頭正規化與成效~Head normalization and repair effect§維修前後地下水頭不同時，流量變化混有外部驅動差異。線性導通度可在有限範圍比較同一路徑，但裂縫開合和多支路連通可能非線性；評估應保留原始水頭與流量，而不是只報一個百分比成效。~Different groundwater heads mix external driving changes into before-after flow. Linear conductance can compare a path over a limited range, but opening and branching may be nonlinear. Preserve original head and flow rather than reporting only a percentage improvement.§conductanceBefore=0.4 L/s/200 kPa=0.002 L/(s*kPa); after=0.6/300=0.002§將修前後流量對水頭繪圖並比較可重疊範圍~Plot before-after flow against head and compare overlapping ranges§低水頭測得小流量被當成材料效果，高水頭時再度漏水~Low-head low flow is credited to material performance and leakage returns at higher head§修後流量比較低就不必再記錄地下水頭~Lower post-repair flow removes the need to record groundwater head
修補材料與濕界面~Repair materials and wet interfaces§材料能否在潮濕界面形成有效密封取決於化學相容、黏結及變形能力，不由單一強度決定。水流可能帶走未穩定材料，基底污染則形成薄弱層；試驗應重現服務環境和裂縫活動，而不是只測乾燥室內黏著。~Sealing a wet interface depends on chemistry, bond and movement capacity rather than one strength. Flow can remove unstable material and contamination creates a weak layer. Tests should represent service moisture and movement instead of only dry laboratory adhesion.§retainedBond=wetBond/dryBond=0.8 MPa/1.6 MPa=0.50§比較濕態黏結、變形循環及水質相容試驗證據~Compare wet bond, movement cycling and water-chemistry compatibility evidence§乾態合格材料在濕界面剝離，留下隱藏通水薄層~A material passing dry tests debonds wet and leaves a hidden water-conducting layer§乾燥試驗黏得牢就能保證潮濕裂縫修補有效~Strong dry adhesion guarantees effective repair of a wet crack
排水保留與壓力轉移~Drainage preservation and pressure transfer§某些出水口本來承擔洩壓功能，封閉後水壓可能轉移到襯砌或相鄰接縫。修繕應先確認設計水路，不能把所有流出都當成缺陷；需要在漏水控制和結構承壓之間保持一致，並考慮排水堵塞情境。~Some outlets provide intended pressure relief; closing them transfers pressure to lining or adjacent joints. Identify the designed water path before calling all discharge defective. Keep leakage control consistent with structural pressure resistance, including a blocked-drain scenario rather than local appearance alone.§Inputs rho=1000 kg/m3, g=9.81 m/s2, headIncrease=3 m; pressureIncrease=rho*g*headIncrease=1000*9.81*3=29430 Pa=29.43 kPa§對照原排水圖、封堵前後水壓及相鄰接縫反應~Compare original drainage drawings, pressure changes and neighbouring-joint responses§封住唯一洩壓出口後產生新裂縫，局部變乾卻整體惡化~Closing the only relief outlet creates new cracks despite a dry local surface§所有隧道出水口都應該封死才能改善結構~Every tunnel water outlet should be sealed to improve the structure
腐蝕暴露與污染物質量~Corrosion exposure and contaminant mass§滲漏把水與侵蝕離子帶到鋼材，濃度和接觸時間共同影響暴露。單次水質樣本不能代表季節變化，表面鏽跡也不等於截面損失量；應把流量、水質、材料位置及可測厚度連結，分開環境負荷與結構損傷。~Leakage delivers water and aggressive ions, with concentration and exposure duration both relevant. One sample misses seasonal changes, while visible rust is not a section-loss measurement. Link flow, chemistry, material position and measured thickness, separating environmental loading from structural damage.§chlorideLoad=0.1 L/s*500 mg/L=50 mg/s=4.32 kg/day§以代表性水樣、接觸時間及鋼材厚度量測追蹤暴露~Track exposure using representative water samples, contact duration and steel thickness§只清除鏽跡未處理水路，持續腐蝕使截面逐漸減少~Rust removal without water-path control allows continuing corrosion and section loss§把表面鏽斑清乾淨就表示腐蝕問題已解決~Cleaning visible rust stains proves the corrosion problem is resolved
維修驗證與觀察期間~Repair verification and observation period§修補完成時的乾燥只證明當下狀態，應經過能代表服務水頭與溫度變化的觀察。驗證範圍要包含相鄰漏點和排水總量，避免水路轉移被當成成功；測試條件與材料養護階段也應保持可追溯。~A dry surface at completion establishes only that moment. Observe conditions representative of service head and temperature, including neighbouring leaks and total drainage so rerouting is not mistaken for success. Retain test conditions and material-curing stages for reproducible interpretation.§observationCoverage=observedRequiredConditions/requiredConditions=3/4=75 percent§逐項核對高低水頭、溫度循環及相鄰區域的觀察紀錄~Audit observations across required heads, thermal cycles and adjacent areas§只在乾季驗收造成假性成功，濕季服務條件尚未驗證~Dry-season acceptance creates false success while wet-season service conditions remain unverified§完工當天表面乾燥就能保證全年水密合格~A dry completion-day surface guarantees year-round watertightness
修繕履歷與重複缺陷~Repair history and recurrent defects§反覆漏水可能來自原水路未辨認、持續位移或材料不相容，重做同一修法未必有效。履歷須連結缺陷位置、材料、施工條件和後續水頭，才能比較原因；沒有完整版本的修補圖會讓新團隊誤把舊補丁當成原始構造。~Recurring leakage can reflect unidentified paths, ongoing movement or incompatibility, so repeating the same treatment may fail. Link defect locations, materials, installation conditions and later heads. Without revision-controlled maps a new team can mistake an old patch for original construction.§recurrenceFraction=recurringLocations/repairedLocations=4/20=20 percent§將每次修補範圍、材料批次及復發條件按位置索引~Index repair extents, material batches and recurrence conditions by location§反覆覆貼掩蓋原裂縫與排水路徑，使診斷越來越困難~Repeated overlays conceal original cracks and drainage paths and make diagnosis progressively harder§同一位置再次漏水只需要原方法再做一次~A recurring leak only requires repeating the original repair method
''')
